Id: time005w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_timesync
Fix: Give the daemon at least three sources that answer; four is the usual.
References: chrony.conf(5); ntp.conf(5)
Controls: CIS 8.4; NIST AU-8, SC-45; ISO 8.17

Fewer than three of the time daemon's sources answer. NTP finds a
bad source by voting: with three, one liar is outvoted; with fewer,
a failing or spoofed server sets the clock and nothing disagrees.
Give chronyd 'pool' or 'server' lines, or ntpd 'server' lines, until
at least three answer; four is the usual number.
